[0.000, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m \u001b[0m\u001b[33mAgent Folder Security\u001b[0m\u001b[33m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Some agents may store credentials, auth tokens, or other identifying and private artifacts in the agent folder within your project.                               \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Consider adding \u001b[36m.claude/\u001b[0m (or parts of it) to \u001b[36m.gitignore\u001b[0m to prevent accidental credential leakag"]
