[0.149, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G2026-10-03. I took the project name from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPROMPTS.md\u001b[39m. There were no extension hooks to\u001b[89Grun,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbecause \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.specify/extensions.yml\u001b[39m doesn't exist.                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPrinciples\u001b[22m                                                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mI. Every Behavior Is Tested (non-negotiable):\u001b[22m every endpoint, rule and error response\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bneeds an automated test. Tests run with a single command and must pass before a change\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcounts as done. Every\u001b[27Gbug\u001b[31Gfix\u001b[35Gcomes\u001b[41Gwith\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gtest\u001b[53Gthat\u001b[58Gfails\u001b[64Gwithout\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gfix.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mII. Exact Money Arithmetic (non-negotiable):\u001b[22m                                     \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Money is stored as whole cents or as an exact decimal type, never as floating point.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- When\u001b[12Gan\u001b[15Gamount\u001b[22Gis\u001b[25Gspli"]
[0.001, "o", "t,\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gparts\u001b[42Gmust\u001b[47Gadd\u001b[51Gup\u001b[54Gto\u001b[57Gexactly\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Goriginal\u001b[78Gamount.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B Leftover cents are handed out by a fixed, documented rule.                     \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- A group's balances must add up to exactly zero, and the suggested settle-up transfers\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B must clear all debts exactly.                                                  \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- The API rejects amounts with more decimal places than the currency allows, rather\u001b[89Gthan\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B rounding them.                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOther sections\u001b[22m                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMoney Handling Constraints:\u001b[22m money tests must cover uneven splits (for example €10.00\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsplit three ways) and check that balances add up to zero. Rounding is only allowed\u001b[88Gat\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bone clearly named step.                                   "]
[0.001, "o", "                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mQuality Gates:\u001b[22m the plan must say how money is stored and how leftover cents are handed\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bout. A feature is only done when every behavior in its spec has a test.          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mGovernance:\u001b[22m the constitution overrides anything that conflicts with it, and changes\u001b[89Gto\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit get a new version number. Every plan and review must check against both principles.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gleft out the template's three other principle slots because you gave two rules and\u001b[88GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdidn't want\u001b[15Gto\u001b[18Ginvent\u001b[25Gmore.\u001b[31GThere\u001b[37Gare\u001b[41Gno\u001b[44Gopen\u001b[49GTODOs.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe file starts with a change summary in an HTML comment. Remove it before committing.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSuggested commit message: \u001b["]
[0.001, "o", "38;2;177;185;249mdocs: ratify constitution v1.0.0 (test coverage + exact money \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprinciples)\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B                                                                                \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;223;134;102mCreating…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(running Stop hook · 32s · ↓\u001b[42G2.8k tokens · thought for 6s)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw\u001b[20Gto as\u001b[27Ga quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.233, "o", "\u001b]0;✳ Claude Code\u0007"]
