[0.112, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2;35r\u001b[12S\u001b[r\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m      +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m;153m1\\u001b[39m\\u001b[40;1H\\u001b[38;3H\\u001b[?25h\\u001b[?2026l\"]                                                                                 \r\u001b[19B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m95\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1mspecs/001-expense-splitting-api/research.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m# Research: Expense Splitting API\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22m## 1. Language and web framework\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  4 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  5 \u001b[22m- **Decision**: Python 3.12 with FastAPI (Pydantic v2 for request validation), served by\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m  Uvicorn. Project and dependencies managed with `uv`.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m- **Rationale**: Python integers are arbitrary precision, so integer-cent arithmetic is exact\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m  with no overflow. FastAPI gives typed request/response models, automat"]
[0.001, "o", "ic validation errors\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m  and OpenAPI output that matches `contracts/openapi.yaml`, and an in-process `TestClient`\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m  that makes API-level tests fast. Python 3.12 is installed locally.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +85 lines \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mMisting…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m 23s · ↓\u001b[24G6.7k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
