[0.001, "o", "                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 249 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- [\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mX\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m] T039 CRITICAL: Add API tests asserting the 422 `validation_error` response shape (and `field` where applicable) for currently untested behavio\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrs: malformed JSON body (`{bad`) and empty body on `POST /groups`; a JSON array body on `POST /groups`; non-string items in `participant_ids` (`[1]`\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m) on `POST /groups/{id}/expenses`; an extra field on `POST /groups/{id}/members`; and acceptance (201) of a description of exactly 200 characters — \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  \u001b[10G +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242min\u001b[15G`tests/api/test_groups.py`,\u001b[43G`tests/api/test_members.py`,\u001b[72G`tests/api/test_expenses.py`\u001b[101Gper\u001b[105GConstitution\u001b[118GI\u001b[120G(partial)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 250 \u001b[22m - [ ] T040 Let `POST /groups` accept an optional `members: list[str]` (each name \"Required; trimmed; 1–100 chars\", uniqu"]
[0.002, "o", "e per group case-insensitive\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m , max 20; any invalid or duplicate name rejects the whole request with nothing stored) and return them in `GroupOut.members`, so group + members + e\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m xpense + balances takes 4 requests; update `CreateGroup` in `src/splitit/schemas.py`, `InMemoryRepository.create_group` in `src/splitit/repository.p\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m y`, the route in `src/splitit/api.py`, the `CreateGroup` schema in `specs/001-expense-splitting-api/contracts/openapi.yaml`, and add tests in `tests\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m /api/test_groups.py` including a 4-request end-to-end flow per SC-004 (partial)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 251 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- [\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m \u001b[48;2;61;1;0m] T041 Strip Pydantic's `\"Value error, \"` prefix from validation messages in `_handle_request_validation` in `src/splitit/errors.py` so messages\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m     -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m read e.g. `amount: invalid amount '10.005': expected exactly two decimals`, "]
